ros2graph
Copyright 2026 Vincent Pu and contributors.

The graph renderer and observation components originated in SO-Arm Station
Runtime, https://github.com/vincent-tvincent/soarm-station-runtime,
source revision 317ea603d13766ef09f3f074f2c34b21e3bbcabe.
They have been extracted and adapted for robot-independent use.

This distribution contains no LeRobot, model weights, robot calibration,
device drivers, fonts, or third-party JavaScript bundles. ROS 2, aiohttp,
LTTng and Babeltrace are separate dependencies under their respective licenses.
